@startuml
title EN-027.4 — Publicación at-least-once de catalog.product.created

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Administrador" as admin
participant "Catalog API" as api
database "MongoDB Catalog\nproducts + audit_log + outbox" as mongo
participant "Outbox Dispatcher\nCatalog" as dispatcher
queue "SQS Standard\ncatalog-product-created" as sqs
participant "Notifications Worker" as worker
database "Inbox / Idempotency\nNotifications" as inbox
queue "SQS DLQ" as dlq

== Creación y outbox ==

admin -> api : POST /api/v1/catalog/products
api -> mongo : begin transaction
api -> mongo : product + audit_log + outbox(eventId)
alt falla cualquier escritura
  mongo --> api : abort 0/3
  api --> admin : error; no hay evento publicable
else commit 3/3
  mongo --> api : commit
  api --> admin : 201 Product
end

== Despacho recuperable ==

dispatcher -> mongo : reclamar outbox por lease
mongo --> dispatcher : eventId + envelope V1
dispatcher -> sqs : SendMessage(eventId estable)
alt envío falla
  sqs --> dispatcher : error transitorio
  dispatcher -> mongo : liberar/expirar lease; conservar pendiente
else envío aceptado
  sqs --> dispatcher : éxito
  dispatcher -> mongo : marcar entregado
end

note over mongo,sqs
  Una caída después de SendMessage y antes de marcar
  entregado produce duplicado. No se promete exactly-once.
end note

== Consumo idempotente ==

worker -> sqs : ReceiveMessage long poll (20 s)
sqs --> worker : body + receiptHandle + ApproximateReceiveCount
worker -> worker : validar eventType + eventVersion + schema

alt envelope o versión inválida
  worker -> dlq : dead-letter controlado
  worker -> sqs : DeleteMessage original
else válido
  worker -> inbox : insertar eventId con unicidad
  alt eventId ya procesado
    inbox --> worker : duplicado
    worker -> sqs : DeleteMessage
  else primer procesamiento
    worker -> worker : materializar cambio de catálogo\n(sin fan-out SQS por jugador)
    worker -> inbox : confirmar efecto procesado
    alt efecto confirmado
      worker -> sqs : DeleteMessage
    else error transitorio
      worker -> sqs : no borrar / ChangeMessageVisibility
      note right of sqs
        El próximo receive incrementa
        ApproximateReceiveCount.
      end note
    end
  end
end

== Redrive ==

loop hasta maxReceiveCount = 5
  sqs -> worker : reentrega; orden no garantizado
end
sqs -> dlq : redrive automático tras el quinto fallo

alt causa corregida y redrive autorizado
  admin -> dlq : iniciar redrive auditado
  dlq -> sqs : devolver mensajes
  sqs -> worker : reentrega con el mismo eventId
  worker -> inbox : deduplicar antes del efecto
end

note over sqs,worker
  La cola es punto a punto para Notifications.
  Un futuro segundo bounded context requiere su propia cola
  y una decisión explícita de fan-out.
end note

@enduml